    rdfs:label "Mitchison (1980, 1981) & Feugier, Mochizuki & Iwasa (2005) with-the-flux auxin canalization: exponent bifurcation, growing hex-lamina canalization (solved), Sachs wound bypass (solved + prescribed), hand-drawn Feugier venation templates, and cleared-leaf specimen segmentation (Pisum sativum & Arabidopsis thaliana (dicot leaf lamina & stem vascular strands))" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mitchison-canalization-auxin-flux-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/mitchison-canalization-auxin-flux-2>,
