    dct:description "Ten references with DOIs in the audit, README and two BibTeX files; six dataset files SHA-256 pinned and verified fail-closed at runtime (EXPECTED_SHA256 L82-91, `verify_dataset_integrity` L97-110), with the Pass 1-2 files left byte-identical and the growing-lamina parameters cross-checked against the pinned JSON in self-test check 1 (L1733-1740); the specimen keeps its licence, URL and hash. Deductions: the Pass 1-2 reference JSON's numeric benchmarks (winner shares per exponent, Sachs 1.38 / 0.985 / 0.08, Feugier beta_1 = 14) are not digitised from any figure and are now acknowledged as such, yet the file still presents them as \"_ref\" values (-8); the five new DOIs were added from the assessor's knowledge and not resolved online during this run (-4); `tracked_by` issue #34 and the repository URL are unverified (-2); the specimen's species is unknown (\"dicot\") so the Rolland-Lagan 54.5 deg reference is generic (-2)." ;
